# REST Client tests for admin-service. Copy rows into docs/api-test-plan.md (ID, request, expected, actual, pass/fail).
# Local run (npm run dev) uses @local; after deploy, switch @baseUrl to the Floci API (platform/vars.sh prints API_ID).
@local = http://localhost:3000
@floci = http://REPLACE_API_ID.execute-api.localhost.floci.io:4566
# API_ID changes after a Floci reset: run  source platform/vars.sh && echo $API_ID  and paste it above.
@baseUrl = {{local}}
@site = http://localhost:4566

### T-ADM-01 health: 200 { status: ok, runtime: local | lambda }, security headers, Cache-Control: no-store
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### T-ADM-02 unknown route: 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND (on Floci, API Gateway answers {"message":"Not Found"} instead)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nope

### T-ADM-03 bad JSON: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR "Request body is not valid JSON." (body parsing runs before routing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Content-Type: application/json

{bad

### T-ADM-04 CORS, our site: response has Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:4566
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: {{site}}

### T-ADM-05 CORS, other site: no Access-Control-Allow-Origin header (Lab 7 T6)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: http://evil.example

### T-ADM-06 preflight: 204 with Access-Control-Allow-Methods
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: {{site}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: PATCH
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization,content-type

### T-ADM-07 security headers on every response: nosniff, DENY, CSP default-src 'none', Cache-Control no-store, no X-Powered-By
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

# ---------- POST /api/admin/scholarships (create a draft) ----------

### T-ADM-08 no token: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### T-ADM-09 student token: 403 FORBIDDEN, and a "forbidden" row in AuditLog with targetId /api/admin/scholarships
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Authorization: Bearer test-student-1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### T-ADM-10 wrong Content-Type: 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Authorization: Bearer test-admin
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### T-ADM-11 weights sum to 90: 400 "Rubric weights must sum to 100 (they sum to 90)."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Authorization: Bearer test-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud Excellence Award", "description": "For students building on the cloud.",
  "deadline": "2027-01-15T23:59:00Z", "awards": 2,
  "rubric": [
    { "criterionId": "academic", "name": "Academic record", "description": "Grades and transcript", "weight": 40 },
    { "criterionId": "essay", "name": "Essay", "description": "Clarity and motivation", "weight": 40 },
    { "criterionId": "need", "name": "Financial need", "description": "Evidence of need", "weight": 10 }
  ],
  "eligibility": { "allowedDomains": ["example-university.edu"], "minGpa": 3, "years": [2, 3] }
}

### T-ADM-14 duplicate criterionId: 400 "Rubric criterionId "academic" is used twice."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Authorization: Bearer test-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud Excellence Award", "description": "For students building on the cloud.",
  "deadline": "2027-01-15T23:59:00Z", "awards": 2,
  "rubric": [
    { "criterionId": "academic", "name": "Academic record", "description": "Grades and transcript", "weight": 50 },
    { "criterionId": "academic", "name": "Essay", "description": "Clarity and motivation", "weight": 50 }
  ],
  "eligibility": { "allowedDomains": ["example-university.edu"], "minGpa": 3, "years": [2, 3] }
}

### T-ADM-15 domain that is not a partner university: 400 not a partner university
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Authorization: Bearer test-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud Excellence Award", "description": "For students building on the cloud.",
  "deadline": "2027-01-15T23:59:00Z", "awards": 2,
  "rubric": [
    { "criterionId": "academic", "name": "Academic record", "description": "Grades and transcript", "weight": 50 },
    { "criterionId": "essay", "name": "Essay", "description": "Clarity and motivation", "weight": 50 }
  ],
  "eligibility": { "allowedDomains": ["bue.edu.eg"], "minGpa": 3, "years": [2, 3] }
}

### T-ADM-17 valid, with server-only fields in the body: 201 draft, acceptedCount 0, createdBy test-admin, new UUID (body values ignored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships
Authorization: Bearer test-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud Excellence Award", "description": "For students building on the cloud.",
  "deadline": "2027-01-15T23:59:00Z", "awards": 2,
  "rubric": [
    { "criterionId": "academic", "name": "Academic record", "description": "Grades and transcript", "weight": 40 },
    { "criterionId": "essay", "name": "Essay", "description": "Clarity and motivation", "weight": 40 },
    { "criterionId": "need", "name": "Financial need", "description": "Evidence of need", "weight": 20 }
  ],
  "eligibility": { "allowedDomains": ["example-university.edu"], "minGpa": 3, "years": [2, 3] },
  "status": "published", "acceptedCount": 99, "createdBy": "hacker", "scholarshipId": "chosen-by-client"
}
